---
title: "Museum & Critterpedia | Hopscotch"
layout: base.njk
permalink: /shrines/animalcrossing/newhorizons/museum/
customcss: '/assets/css/acnh/hopscotch.css'
---
<main class="hs-shell hs-museum">
  {% include "acnh/nav.njk" %}
  <header class="hs-page-hero hs-page-hero--mint">
    <div><span class="hs-eyebrow">a visit with blathers</span><h1>Little museum of wonders <span aria-hidden="true">✿</span></h1><p>From tiny garden bugs to deep-sea oddities. My caught collection and museum donations, all in one cosy place.</p></div>
    <div class="hs-page-hero__stamp"><strong id="museumTotalDonated">—</strong><span>museum donations</span></div>
  </header>

  <section class="hs-section" aria-labelledby="hs-museum-title">
    <div class="hs-section-title"><div><span class="hs-eyebrow">choose a wing</span><h2 id="hs-museum-title">The collection rooms</h2></div><span class="hs-section-title__decoration">✿</span></div>
    <div class="hs-museum-tabs" role="group" aria-label="Museum collection category">
      <button type="button" data-category="fish" class="hs-museum-tab is-active" aria-pressed="true"><span class="hs-museum-tab__emoji">🐟</span><strong>Fish</strong><small id="stat-fish">— / 80</small></button>
      <button type="button" data-category="bugs" class="hs-museum-tab" aria-pressed="false"><span class="hs-museum-tab__emoji">🦋</span><strong>Bugs</strong><small id="stat-bugs">— / 80</small></button>
      <button type="button" data-category="sea" class="hs-museum-tab" aria-pressed="false"><span class="hs-museum-tab__emoji">🫧</span><strong>Sea life</strong><small id="stat-sea">— / 40</small></button>
      <button type="button" data-category="fossils" class="hs-museum-tab" aria-pressed="false"><span class="hs-museum-tab__emoji">🦴</span><strong>Fossils</strong><small id="stat-fossils">— / 73</small></button>
      <button type="button" data-category="art" class="hs-museum-tab" aria-pressed="false"><span class="hs-museum-tab__emoji">🖼️</span><strong>Artwork</strong><small id="stat-art">— / 43</small></button>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="hs-panel hs-now-bar" id="acnhNowPanel" aria-label="Current critter availability">
    <div><span class="hs-eyebrow">today's little adventure</span><h2>What's around?</h2><p id="availableNowText">Loading critter availability…</p></div>
    <div class="hs-now-bar__stats"><span><b id="missingNowCount">—</b> missing now</span><span><b id="leavingCount">—</b> leaving this month</span></div>
  </section>

  <section class="hs-panel hs-filter-panel" aria-label="Collection filters">
    <label class="hs-filter hs-filter--search">Search <input id="museumSearch" type="search" placeholder="a little fish, a butterfly…" autocomplete="off"></label>
    <label class="hs-filter">Show <select id="museumStatus"><option value="all">Everything</option><option value="missing">Still missing</option><option value="found">Caught / found</option><option value="undonated">Need donating</option><option value="donated">Donated</option></select></label>
    <label class="hs-filter" id="monthControl">Month <select id="museumMonth"><option value="1">January</option><option value="2">February</option><option value="3">March</option><option value="4">April</option><option value="5">May</option><option value="6">June</option><option value="7">July</option><option value="8">August</option><option value="9">September</option><option value="10">October</option><option value="11">November</option><option value="12">December</option></select></label>
    <label class="hs-filter" id="hourControl">Hour <select id="museumHour">{% for hour in range(0, 24) %}<option value="{{ hour }}">{% if hour < 10 %}0{% endif %}{{ hour }}:00</option>{% endfor %}</select></label>
    <label class="hs-filter" id="locationControl">Location <select id="museumLocation"><option value="all">Anywhere</option></select></label>
    <div class="hs-filter-chips"><button type="button" id="showAvailableNow" class="hs-chip">☀ Available now</button><button type="button" id="showLeaving" class="hs-chip">🍂 Leaving soon</button><button type="button" id="resetMuseumFilters" class="hs-chip">Clear filters</button></div>
  </section>

  <div class="hs-results-heading"><p><strong id="museumResultsCount">—</strong> little discoveries <span id="museumLoading" role="status">· loading the collection…</span></p><span>♡ caught and donated are different things ♡</span></div>
  <section class="hs-museum-grid" id="museumGrid" aria-live="polite"></section>
  <div class="hs-load-more-wrap"><button type="button" id="museumLoadMore" class="hs-button" hidden>Show a few more ✿</button></div>

  <footer class="hs-footer">Catalogue icons: <a href="https://github.com/alexislours/ACNHAPI">ACNH API</a> · Artwork belongs to Nintendo · <a href="https://nook.lol/Bd1QBl09lGZ">my Critterpedia scan</a> ♡</footer>
</main>
<script id="acnh-museum-progress" type="application/json">{{ acnh.museumProgress | dump | safe }}</script>
<script id="acnh-island-settings" type="application/json">{{ acnh.island | dump | safe }}</script>
<script src="/assets/js/acnh-museum.js" defer></script>
